WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.600
Here's how this lunchbox comes apart.

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:07.300
Flip both side clips down,
then lift the lid.

3
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.300
The small tray lifts straight out,

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.600
so you can pack each section separately.

5
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.640
Put the tray back,
line up the lid,

6
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.000
and press both clips closed.

7
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.280
That's the whole routine:

8
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.040
open, pack, close.

9
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.080
Tomorrow, lift the tray out
and start again.
